{"3800480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wilds of the Realmwalker", "steam_appid": 3800480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a magical world of spellcraft, survival, and exploration in Wilds of the Realmwalker, a 1 -4 player cooperative adventure where you and your magical companion uncover secrets, restore ruins, and build across wild, mystical realms. As a Realmwalker, master elemental magic, traverse Spellgates, and team up to survive, craft, and create cozy memories. From lush ruins to molten lava flows, discover the Wilds together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative Survival</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, manage hunger, stamina, and survive the elements while journeying through the diverse wilds</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic and Spellcrafting</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel elemental magic to build, fight, and explore. Customize your spellbook with crafted spells and arcane tools</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and Discovery</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the mysterious Wilds through ancient Spellgates. Each realm offers unique biomes, resources, enemies, and secrets to uncover.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building and Crafting</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Shelters, crafting stations, and mystical contraptions. Shape your surroundings and prepare for the unknown.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystical Companions</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every team is joined by a magical creature that grows alongside them. Personalize your wizard, gea,r and companion to suit your playstyle.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restoration and Worldbuilding</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ruins and restoration sites where you bring ancient magic back to life and unlock hidden lore</p></li></ul></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a magical world of spellcraft, survival, and exploration in Wilds of the Realmwalker, a 1 -4 player cooperative adventure where you and your magical companion uncover secrets, restore ruins, and build across wild, mystical realms. As a Realmwalker, master elemental magic, traverse Spellgates, and team up to survive, craft, and create cozy memories. From lush ruins to molten lava flows, discover the Wilds together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative Survival</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, manage hunger, stamina, and survive the elements while journeying through the diverse wilds</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic and Spellcrafting</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel elemental magic to build, fight, and explore. Customize your spellbook with crafted spells and arcane tools</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and Discovery</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the mysterious Wilds through ancient Spellgates. Each realm offers unique biomes, resources, enemies, and secrets to uncover.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building and Crafting</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Shelters, crafting stations, and mystical contraptions. Shape your surroundings and prepare for the unknown.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystical Companions</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every team is joined by a magical creature that grows alongside them. Personalize your wizard, gea,r and companion to suit your playstyle.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"b